<title>INDIA: India RBI sets repo cut-off at 3.60 pct.</title>
<headline>India RBI sets repo cut-off at 3.60 pct.</headline>
<dateline>BOMBAY 1997-08-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Reserve Bank of India (RBI) said it set a cut-off interest rate of 3.60 percent at Thursday's repo auction.  </p>
<p>The RBI said it received and accepted one bid for 20 billion rupees. The weighted average cut-off rate worked out to 3.60 percent.</p>
<p>-- Bombay Newsroom (91) 22 265 9000; Fax (91) 22 264 1699</p>
